<title>USA: Franklin Credit sets reverse split.</title>
<headline>Franklin Credit sets reverse split.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Franklin Credit Manangement Corp said on Monday it had set a one-for-five reverse stock split that would reduce the number of shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The number of shares outstanding would be reduced from 5.5 million shares to 1.1 million shares, a spokesman for the company said.</p>
